> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Engineering foundation, research/PSU pathway</td> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>₹2L – ₹15L total</td> </tr> <tr data-astro-cid-ug7vciio> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio><strong data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Aviation Management Diplomas</strong></td> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Targeting airport/airline operations, ground staff</td> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Shorter duration, lower entry barrier, corporate roles</td> <td data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>₹1L – ₹5L total</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div class="table-scroll-hint" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>← Scroll horizontally on mobile →</div> </div> <div class="callout" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio> <strong data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Universal Truth</strong>
