</p> </div> <div class="domain-card" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio> <div class="domain-header" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio> <span class="domain-emoji" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>🌍</span> <h3 data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Global Aviation Pathways</h3> </div> <p class="domain-desc" data-astro-cid-ug7vciio> <strong data-astro-cid-ug7vciio>Includes:</strong> Overseas CPL training, Foreign AME licenses, International airline recruitment
